Notes:
  ZENITH hybrid: BM25 + vector semantic + fuzzy + phonetic (ONNX or deterministic fallback).
  ZENITH BM25: pure lexical — directly comparable to SQLite FTS5 and Bleve.
  SQLite FTS5 via mattn/go-sqlite3 (CGo — same bar as ZENITH hybrid ONNX).
  Bleve: BM25 + Levenshtein fuzzy, pure Go, no CGo required.
  All engines run in-process. No HTTP, no Docker.
  Recall@10: queries whose relevant passage exists in the indexed subset only.
